        "explanation": "Explanation:\nFor the first query, there are two maximal increasing subsequences (1,3)(1, 3)(1,3) and (2,4)(2, 4)(2,4), but only one maximal decreasing subsequence (3,2)(3, 2)(3,2)."
      }
    ]
